ed579a62be8bc4END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_UNI_LOW_LetterFromSmallTimeCrook</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_UNI_LOW_LetterFromSmallTimeCrook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_UNI_LOW_LetterFromSmallTimeCrook\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">2c816896-1df2-4000-81be-0eeba1166f15</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:2c816896-1df2-4000-81be-0eeba1166f15\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:2c816896-1df2-4000-81be-0eeba1166f15\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the basement of <a href=\"/wiki/Bruc_and_Pishe%27s_Emporium\" title=\"Bruc and Pishe's Emporium\">Bruc and Pishe's Emporium</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-2336&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;1064</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Keene\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Keene\">Keene</a>\n</p><p><br>\nNothing so sad as an old wolf who doesn't know her time leading the pack is done. So consider this your notice: the Stone Lord's got you running scared, and now you're hiding behind the <a href=\"/wiki/Zhentarim\" title=\"Zhentarim\">Zhentarim</a> to keep him from your door - my crew and I won't cower in the <a href=\"/wiki/Guildhall\" title=\"Guildhall\">Guildhall</a> along with you. If you can't beat the Stone Lord, then I suppose we'll just have to join him.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715163755\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.057 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.060 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1351/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 24146/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6000/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.013/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936097/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   49.632      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   49.632      1 -total\n 45.02%   22.343      6 Template:Icon_text\n 40.36%   20.034     15 Template:Trim\n 22.01%   10.922      2 Template:Uid\n 19.33%    9.595      1 Template:Main_only\n 12.88%    6.394      2 Template:Template_style\n 12.57%    6.237      1 Template:PageSeo\n 12.37%    6.139      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 11.06%    5.491      1 Template:Notes\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:35182-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715163755 and revision id 396937. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}